    "15": {
      "annotation": "LABEL-FREE: no gold file. Supplying labels here would make the clustering a fit rather than a prediction.\nResolves against PyEuk at current master, NOT the d8e45a81 pin the Cyclospora LoFreq/PyEuk arm uses. Two post-pin fixes are required here: 37f59a3, without which unobserved allele columns compress every distance about fivefold, and 13b808d, without which the minimum-cluster-size guard makes k&gt;1 unreachable for any cohort of n&lt;=9 and collapsed a 10-specimen 3-species cohort to k=1.",
